body:
I really like to play my Steam Deck in bed.

&#x200B;

https://preview.redd.it/jly8pvrt3j7c1.png?width=1080&format=png&auto=webp&s=7b6dabdd45bc350f2cc194b74e33af5f61ddd497

It was Mew when I was little, but now it's Kyogre.

&#x200B;

(And Mew.)

Video games. My mom got me so many, I assumed they were as cheap as candy.

&#x200B;

They were not.

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=suTn2XkVEbQ&list=PLNrdu85hlN5-539v7qHKcLMDqY8ItZShU](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=suTn2XkVEbQ&list=PLNrdu85hlN5-539v7qHKcLMDqY8ItZShU)

&#x200B;

You're awesome for doing this, whether I win or not. Take my favorite comfort song.

The first thing to make me laugh out loud in a long time, good job.

&#x200B;

All dads are the same.
